## ranking of the non-cosmetic classes (modelling judgement)
1. TWO-PLACE (REALVAL): the only class that sees the sheet AND the drift AND is orbitwise (defect-aware); it names one new open statement (HYP-9139) and no new mechanism.
2. NEW OBJECT (MONOID): an exact equivalent of Collatz on the diagonal of the exponent lattice with a proved divergence theorem off it; the square gate is synchronisation, not a mechanism.
3. EXACT MODEL (DLOG): the parity graph is the +-sqrt graph on F_p^* for Fermat primes; useful as a picture of THM-4474, adds no predicate.
4. RESIDUE LAW (QCHAR, JACOBI, LOCSQ): exact word-function lemmas; sheet-blind by construction.
5. SPARSE, SIGN TRANSFER, SIDE CONSTRAINT, FAMILY VIEW: exact but without measure or leverage.
6. COSMETIC, DEGENERATE, BLOCKED: recorded so that they are not regenerated.
